OL,3,GNEWSACould light stop most common food
OL,4,Apoisoning cause?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blue light could significantly reduce
OL,7,Fthe amount of food poisoning caused by
OL,8,Fraw chicken, scientists have found.
OL,10,FThe University of Reading research
OL,11,Ffound shining violet-blue light onto
OL,12,Fcampylobacter, the most common global
OL,13,Fcause of bacterial food poisoning,
OL,14,Fkilled all 64 strains tested in a lab.
OL,16,FCampylobacter, which can cause stomach
OL,17,Fcramps and bloody diarrhoea, is found
OL,18,Fin about three quarters of raw chicken
OL,19,Fsold in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
