OL,3,GNEWSACould light stop most common food
OL,4,Apoisoning cause?
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearchers said trials on naturally
OL,7,Fcontaminated carcasses were needed
OL,8,Fbefore the technology could be used
OL,9,Fcommercially.
